## Data Loading

### Loading States
```typescript
const loading = ref(false)

async function fetchData() {
  loading.value = true
  try {
    uni.showLoading({ title: '加载中...' })
    const res = await apis.getData()
    return res
  } finally {
    loading.value = false
    uni.hideLoading()
  }
}
```

### Pull-down Refresh
```typescript
import { onPullDownRefresh } from '@dcloudio/uni-app'

onPullDownRefresh(async () => {
  await refreshData()
  uni.stopPullDownRefresh()
})
```

### Reach Bottom (Load More)
```typescript
import { onReachBottom } from '@dcloudio/uni-app'

onReachBottom(() => {
  if (!loading.value && !finished.value) {
    loadMore()
  }
})
```

## TailwindCSS Styling

### rpx Units - The 750rpx Viewport

**CRITICAL**: uni-app viewport is **always 750rpx** regardless of device. When converting from Figma:
- Design 375px wide → multiply by 2 (100px → 200rpx)
- Design 750px wide → use directly (200px → 200rpx)

