## Error Handling

### API Error Handling
```typescript
async function fetchData() {
  try {
    return await apis.getData()
  } catch (error: any) {
    if (error.code === 401) {
      uni.reLaunch({ url: '/pages/login' })
    } else {
      uni.showToast({ title: error.message || '请求失败', icon: 'none' })
    }
  }
}
```

### Form Validation
```typescript
function validateForm(form: any) {
  if (!form.username) {
    uni.showToast({ title: '请输入用户名', icon: 'none' })
    return false
  }
  if (form.password && form.password.length < 6) {
    uni.showToast({ title: '密码至少6位', icon: 'none' })
    return false
  }
  return true
}
```

## Performance Best Practices

1. **Use v-if for conditional rendering** (not v-show for most cases)
2. **Lazy load images**: `<image :src="url" lazy-load />`
3. **Debounce search inputs**
4. **Virtual lists** for very long lists
5. **Avoid deep nesting** in templates

## Accessibility

1. Use appropriate components (button for actions, navigator for navigation)
2. Add hover feedback: `class="hover:bg-gray-100 active:bg-gray-200"`
3. Ensure touch targets are large enough: `min-h-[88rpx] min-w-[88rpx]`
